### Local scratch #########################################################
# Postman collections export with real bearer tokens and passwords baked
# into their variable blocks, so they're treated as local-only. Commit a
# sanitised copy deliberately if you want it shared.
*postman_collection.json
*postman collection.json

# Generated documentation dump.
PROJECT_STATE.md

